# Extra ComfyUI flags, appended to the service's own ExecStart by comfy/install.sh.
# One flag (with its value) per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Keep 2 GB of VRAM free for the Windows desktop (shares the RX 9070 XT). SDXL fits in the other 14 GB.
--reserve-vram 2
# Unload models after each job so VRAM goes back to Windows when idle. Costs a few seconds per run.
--disable-smart-memory
# Not used: --lowvram (much slower). Try it only if the above isn't enough.
